# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Market Analytics Dashboard — environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is gitignored.
# Next.js loads `.env` automatically at build & runtime, so PM2 needs no extra
# configuration to see these.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Database (PostgreSQL) --------------------------------------------------
# Prisma connects to any Postgres via this single URL.
#
# NATIVE / cPanel deploy (Blue Karma VPS): point at your existing PostgreSQL 16
# on 127.0.0.1:5432 and the dedicated, isolated database you create for this app
# (see DEPLOYMENT.md, step 1). Replace the password with the one you generated:
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://marketanalytic:REPLACE_WITH_DB_PASSWORD@127.0.0.1:5432/marketanalytic?schema=public"
#
# LOCAL Docker-compose dev alternative (bundled Postgres on 55432):
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://marketanalytic:marketanalytic@localhost:55432/marketanalytic?schema=public"
#
# Switching to Supabase/Neon/RDS later = just replace the line above.
# DIRECT_URL="postgresql://..."   # only for pooled providers like Supabase

# --- App --------------------------------------------------------------------
NODE_ENV="production"

# --- Auth (Milestone 9) -----------------------------------------------------
# Secret used to sign the login session cookie. REQUIRED — the app refuses to
# sign in without it. Generate a long random value and keep it stable (rotating
# it signs everyone out):
#   openssl rand -base64 32
AUTH_SECRET="REPLACE_WITH_LONG_RANDOM_STRING"

# --- Docker-compose ONLY (ignored by the native / PM2 deploy) ---------------
# Host port bindings for `docker compose` — localhost-only and non-default so
# they can't clash with the ads/dashboard apps. Not used when running via PM2.
APP_PORT_BIND="127.0.0.1:3100"
DB_PORT_BIND="127.0.0.1:55432"
POSTGRES_USER="marketanalytic"
POSTGRES_PASSWORD="marketanalytic"
POSTGRES_DB="marketanalytic"

# --- Later milestones (not used in Milestone 1) -----------------------------
# Milestone 3/4 (AI column & sheet mapping) and Milestone 12 (AI insights):
# GROQ_API_KEY=""
# GROQ_MODEL="llama-3.3-70b-versatile"
#
# Milestone 9 — Auth (NextAuth):
# NEXTAUTH_URL="https://analytics.bluekarmasecrets.com"
# NEXTAUTH_SECRET=""   # generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
